          ]
        },
        "note": "Turn hashes are unchanged (turn snapshots do not carry resource_suspensions); the emitted state.json and chronicle_bundle.json bytes change."
      }
    ],
    "notes": [
      "T1-3 (wide, from index 23 in corrected_backlog_2026_10) is still in effect, but after EXT-2026-10 no golden workload triggers a tech regression, so reverting T1-3 leaves these oracles unchanged. tests/test_performance_equivalence.py covers its off-mode routing directly."
